{"title":"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afa4cda9946179979d6140ad13149009f3911d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: \\mathbb{Z} \\to \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" />  such that, for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f73d811eca6419d9c9a27423331d71ff06eb957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/5/f95c29ec015f45cfe6ef5ad35572ec2ba15d252a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a +  b+ c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />, the following equality holds:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/d/d1ddb1926e785dfda21ae8914c16b12a91c38237.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(a)^2 + f(b)^2 + f(c)^2 = 2f(a)f(b) + 2f(b)f(c) + 2f(c)f(a).\\]\" width=\"466\" height=\"19\" />\n(Here <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d4023589a374e5b4a1bc6063d887aec205e0d3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> denotes the set of integers.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/3/90342d89fc9cb7e3694ff8c732b3f976d62718f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b = c = 0.$\" width=\"110\" height=\"12\" /> Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/1/69164a5f5a0aec099539874bb46bbf9ffcee2325.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)^2 + f(0)^2 + f(0)^2 = 2f(0)f(0) + 2f(0)f(0) + 2f(0)f(0) \\Rightarrow 3f(0)^2 = 6f(0)^2 \\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"646\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/a/39a52a555533561ad0a7ab36f6761668238ad64f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(0) = 0.\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" />\nNow we look at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f8c8f170f1ff8c118b5a5f361c9dea5db13694f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -a, c = 0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/96087e04de507e7c562583237c42a0f88b1a0506.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)^2 + f(-a)^2 + f(0)^2 = 2f(a)f(-a) + 2f(-a)f(0) + 2f(0)f(a) \\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"537\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d68509f484ce72202b035a7389985a27b9e2d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)^2 + f(-a)^2 = 2f(a)f(-a) \\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"259\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b5ae002a17b88d1ffa9486a3c03284f9bb2a7af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)^2 - 2f(a)f(-a) + f(-a)^2 = 0 \\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"291\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/e/2feb1b7b6afe481987727c11e5cd993ba7be98cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(a) - f(-a))^2=0 \\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"183\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/190926ea5536c9c0a8387e4b99012f0363be3532.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(a)=f(-a).\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/0/0e07240a292e8df0b9db2f5a119a0fc61e4c60fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(c)^2 - 2f(c)(f(a)+f(b)) + (f(a)-f(b))^2 = 0  \\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"397\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/966a7287ee53188f356ff605753a66b293824910.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(c) = f(-c) = f(a+b) =\\frac{2(f(a)+f(b)) \\pm \\sqrt{4(f(a)+f(b))^2 - 4(f(a)-f(b))^2}}{2}\\]\" width=\"626\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85ad91c10e5f6e0598fd3000dd2ec01220291247.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow f(a+b) = f(a) + f(b) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(a)f(b)}\\]\" width=\"317\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/3/7c3acd769b36df86c5e707ed75328218002eb5c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(b) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bf67d556d32bac6b3fe7c48b0638fa7077219ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(a+b) = f(a) = f((a)mod(b))\\]\" width=\"250\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><b>Case 1</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf2144f688a4d3bb3ff3a1bbbc810283ffa842ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 0  \\Rightarrow f(x)= 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536ba5a392431e74fec5a8db2257504c85fcc206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3be04db73828946870d3ccc6d122395a4bacf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c12dda010ebddef028cda1ec9d14986f4a26d07e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Box$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c298c4c507910df0e314cecd991f2b8a1fab5ab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) \\not= 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we will have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/4/f7427edad4474b0156023b8dba3531484ff3d301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = f(1) + f(1) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(1)f(1)} \\Rightarrow f(2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"361\" height=\"32\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/0/4b0694460ac56dd8800359ecc20b63c488b4b9cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 4f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><b>Case 2.1</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/5/ae5f719f6d697f4efab283ad0a19d089ae6f018a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) \\not= 0, f(2) = 0 \\Rightarrow f(x) = f(x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"261\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/0/4a008643cff8271116ac4264437602a0d0c4bdb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mod$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f35e4c9ca9c9549317585f5f64c68a514fe936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2) \\Rightarrow f(x) = f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57ccf8d123ba4259e29fba55d9b008874e071492.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is even. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c12dda010ebddef028cda1ec9d14986f4a26d07e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Box$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p>Case 2.2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc07e40765ba1491d31623b7517c636b81fd165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) \\not= 0, f(2) = 4f(1) \\Rightarrow f(3) = f(2) + f(1) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(2)f(1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"471\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/6/a662d9ca437e25fb27adb8c5f7045398c53922a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(3) = 5f(1) \\pm 4f(1) \\Rightarrow f(3) = f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"313\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/7/407d2849e0462641aef92c4688cdf0120741eb00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><b>Case 2.2.1</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/d/45d79bec8e7c7838b47fa1b0b6b7d266795e5ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) \\not= 0, f(2) = 4f(1), f(3) = f(1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"281\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa151f464a7534d8f419c0b5260b821a8c4f6838.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(4) = f(1) + f(3) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(1)f(3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"291\" height=\"35\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/2/a82b71da83efbecf1c72194de67bebc8664d88f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(4) = f(2) + f(2) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(2)f(2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"268\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/6/b66ad6994340065aed0bc49b52b2b1ed6e29cc93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(4) = f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/b/15bee3d3a6dedffcd514478f86e07ff5ed2cc79a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(4) = 16f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/3189d518ec2ed11c85689d2bbe86d4b872aa6b27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(4) = 0 \\Rightarrow  f(x) = f(x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/0/4a008643cff8271116ac4264437602a0d0c4bdb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mod$\" width=\"34\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/7/4e759d6f747ca965de1832a512a84017d371fa2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4).\\Box$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><b>Case 2.2.2</b>: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3a2fcecf1cefe9489fe627b100f4f1d475bc00a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) \\not= 0, f(2) = 4f(1), f(3) = 9f(1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"290\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/9/22947853026439eff2127feb6b8e64d7e4d4f5ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(4) = f(1 + 3) =  f(1) + f(3) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(1)f(3)} = 16f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"453\" height=\"32\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/0/b203e68076935104e1e37635c8c2a05852deafb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e29993f03dc24f041e460d2e7e13df9a4e6f2680.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(4) = f(2) + f(2) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(2)f(2)} = 16f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"341\" height=\"32\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f181cb746690922daeb9e71882eda849ac53a98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0. \\Rightarrow f(4) = 16f(1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c29a36e6700fb81c679e9146cab5126c3ccd2a59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\le 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/7/8470f43b85418c558ed5b1c0248ae28c85bbcddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = f(1)x^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>We will prove by induction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd62bd837dfe526f11e3e9a2754e3fbcf1aecc95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = f(1)x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536ba5a392431e74fec5a8db2257504c85fcc206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3be04db73828946870d3ccc6d122395a4bacf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d35f2e13e25a8572b7169d06220d1b0a1c835af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\le m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/7/8470f43b85418c558ed5b1c0248ae28c85bbcddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = f(1)x^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"21\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536ba5a392431e74fec5a8db2257504c85fcc206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is true for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>and if the statement is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb9f0a9bb7f1f6cd2d8b3ffd03c41a09994cc103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=k$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/6427542c898002aea0a3988d1af1980df446d996.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(k+1) =  f(k) + f(1) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(k)f(1)} = f(1)(k+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"443\" height=\"32\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/6/7c6d0cab66eaaa727dd410a08b69a6d902796660.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)(k-1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/4/a44a536f603c4a15e39ab10a6f83c4b7d197587a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(k+1) =  f(k-1) + f(2) \\pm 2\\sqrt{f(k-1)f(2)} = f(1)(k+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"486\" height=\"35\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4d402c0c486955992f83c97f490177e4441e8bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)(k-3)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a2e9d39b2f1dbb286a1c8c2543cc0f9295c33f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow f(k+1) = f(1)(k+1)^2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"214\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/843622567e12d686e4e2f94ddfcb444e8ecde0d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" /> the statement is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/8/fd8993931613a264f95d5d9cb070702fe5092c18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" /> as well.\n</p><p>As the statement is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b6979b4da672f436799b1cc7f64c918c60612a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, by mathematical induction we can conclude\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd62bd837dfe526f11e3e9a2754e3fbcf1aecc95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = f(1)x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536ba5a392431e74fec5a8db2257504c85fcc206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/2/bc2573dc632489cc33561a5e849466aed649ec5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.\\Box$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<b>So, Case 2.1, Case 2.2.1 and Case 2.2.2 are the three independent possible solutions.</b>\n</p><p>--Dineshram\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\">IMO Problems and Solutions</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO\" title=\"2012 IMO\">2012 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"